WEBVTT

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:03.650
Good morning, Tsutsui!

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:05.860
Oh, Ito. Good morning.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.610
How was your long weekend?

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.110
Did you have fun at Ayado's house?

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:14.400
Uh, yeah. I-it was just a normal visit.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.570
Yeah, something definitely happened over there.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.320
What's wrong, Ito?

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.400
Ts-Tsutsui...

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.570
I...

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:30.780
Good morning~!

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:41.360
Ba-dump
Ba-dump

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:34.490
Ishino, isn't it a little early in the morning
to be that hyper?

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:38.240
No, it's too early in the morning for you
to be so serious!

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.150
Oh, that reminds me. Was Kaoru okay yesterday?

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:42.900
What? Kaoru?

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:46.780
I went to the amusement park
with him and Anzu and Takanashi.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.240
But I made too much food for lunch.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:51.650
He was acting pretty uncomfortable
the whole rest of the day.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:55.320
Why are you suddenly going
to theme parks with my brother?

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.530
I don't understand anything you're talking about.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:01.650
Oh, come on. You know
Anzu and Kaoru are dating, right?

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:02.740
Yeah...

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:03.610
Well, I...

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:04.280
Arisa!

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:08.150
Oh, good morning, Takanashi.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:11.150
Here, you forgot your headphones yesterday.

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:12.990
Yeah, thanks.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.150
Uh... "Arisa"?

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:17.110
Oh. Yeah.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.900
Because we're dating.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:23.240
What... did you just say, Ishino?

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:27.650
I said, we're dating now. Me and Takanashi.

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:31.110
Is this true, Takanashi?

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:32.280
It's true.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.860
Takanashi,
prepared for
all the
questions

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:34.860
There, you see?

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:38.240
What? Why so serious?

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.780
Why are you getting farther away?

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:43.030
I congratulated both of you, very sincerely!

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:04.740
Konna tokoro de naitetatte

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:10.740
Daremo kizuki ya shinai wakatterunda

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:14.450
Nanmo nakatta ka no you ni

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:20.200
Kako o keshisatte sekai dake susunde yuku

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:25.030
Kimi o utsusu to kimeta film nanoni

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:29.530
Tamatte yuku soko nashi no sora

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:31.360
Wasuretatte kiechainai

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:34.280
Ano itami wa hora, nan dattakke?

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:39.950
Kawaru keshiki mayotte shimatta nara

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:44.070
Ano uta o omoidashite miyou ka

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:49.610
Sou ne, kanashii koto mo futari nara

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:53.400
Takaramono ni natte yuku hazu sa

00:02:53.530 --> 00:03:02.570
Nijinde mo kienakatta

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:07.950
Ano hi no kimi o misetai

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:22.610
Episode 21
Regarding My Choice to Have No Regrets
in My High School Life.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:22.950
I... think I really should tell you, Tsutsui.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.240
Yeah.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:27.400
You were starting to say something
in the classroom this morning.

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:30.200
D-don't tell me you...

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:33.570
Y-yeah. I, um...

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.990
No, that's okay! I don't need the details!

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.400
I just want to ask one thing.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:42.530
Does it really change your whole world?

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.650
My world?

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:57.280
Uh, um, Senpai?

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:00.700
Why are you crying?

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:04.780
I think it's usually the girl who cries in a situation like this.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.900
Was... was it bad?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:13.030
No... I'm just so happy.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.030
I'm happy, too.

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:27.610
Ayado.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.070
The thing is...

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:31.320
I always hated myself.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:37.110
But now, I finally feel like I can start to like myself.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:42.200
Now that you've been kind enough to love me,
I can finally love myself.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.650
Thank you... Ayado.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:50.070
I feel the same way.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:00.990
Tsutsui...

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:03.570
It did change my world.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:09.070
But it might be that the real change is yet to come.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:12.400
We'll make mistakes, end up doing things the hard way.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:17.400
But if Ayado and I keep going,
building our experiences one step at a time,

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:21.150
I think our world will change even more.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.240
I see.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.030
Congratulations, Ito.

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:26.530
Th-thanks.

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:28.650
This is kind of embarrassing.

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:32.950
Whoa, look at this!

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:35.360
You outdid yourself again today.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:38.740
Oh, I get it! We're celebrating me and Takanashi!

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:41.200
Well, it is kind of a tradition, I guess.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:51.900
Ba-dump
Ba-dump

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:45.400
So you CAN do something thoughtful
once in 500 million years!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.780
Not that I'm thrilled about getting Tsutsui's blessing.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:51.860
But since we're here, I'll let you celebrate me.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.400
Wow, two of the worst people have gotten together.

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:56.150
Come on, let's eat!

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.240
Yes, thank you for the dessert!

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:06.110
Hmm... I wonder how many times we'll be able
to get together like this before we graduate.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.200
What?

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:11.700
I'm a high school girl... it's the most
glorious title I'll ever hold in my life.

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:14.570
And there are still so many things I want to do with it.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:16.900
Did you all turn in your career surveys?

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.070
Career survey?

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:20.740
Do you have career plans, Ito?

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:25.280
Yeah. I want to work in anime or video games if I can.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.740
So I think I'll go to a trade school.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.320
That's so like you, Senpai!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.780
But you don't have any plans, do you, Takanashi?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.820
I'm just gonna go to city college.

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:37.740
Uh... oh. That's a safe plan.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:41.070
I'm gonna major in computer science
and be an IT millionaire.

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:44.110
Yeah, and suddenly it sounds completely stupid.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:45.900
So it's all about the money?

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:48.360
Don't think I can't do it. I'm serious.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.320
I want to make life easier for Mom and Anzu.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.490
I see. I'm sorry for calling it stupid.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:58.200
Don't apologize. It's creepy.

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:01.400
I think I'm about done with regular education.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.610
So I'll major in home economics
or lifestyle management.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.110
I want to learn a little more of the feminine arts.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:08.860
And it will be good training for when I become a wife.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.200
Right, Takanashi?

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.740
Who, me?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.780
What?! You guys are getting married?!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.150
What?! I'm getting married to Ishino?!

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:17.360
What? You're not?

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:21.150
What...? No, I...

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:22.240
I thought you said I was going to be an important
part of your life! That was a proposal, wasn't it?

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:25.200
A feeling! I said I got the feeling!

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:28.360
Y-y-you said that to her, Takanashi?

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:30.200
Oh yeah, what about you, Igarashi?

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.530
Hey, what about me?!

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:33.900
Please, you're just going to college, aren't you?

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.860
Y-yeah, but...

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:36.740
And after that?

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:38.570
Uh... after that?

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:40.780
I..I guess I'll be a civil servant.

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.360
Because... there will always be civil servants.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.030
Your life story is boring!

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:46.950
Seriously, have a dream.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.650
Why don't you consider being a pastry chef?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.240
Wow...

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:55.360
They've all really thought about
life after high school, about the next step.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:01.070
Thank you, Tsutsun. They were all delicious.

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:02.740
Glad to hear it.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:06.900
I love seeing everyone smile like that.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:15.610
Last summer, I never would have
imagined things being like this now.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:18.240
Yeah.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:23.530
Um, hey.

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.280
What do you...

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.700
What do you want to do in the future?

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:44.990
Hey, look at this!

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:45.900
What?

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:47.570
Isn't this color adorable?

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:51.030
I figured I'd use this yarn to make mittens for Iroha!

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:52.860
You're awfully enthusiastic.

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:56.200
And while I'm at it, I'll knit you
a stomach warmer or something.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.490
I'm an afterthought?

00:08:58.610 --> 00:09:02.860
Nevermind. You're my mother,
so shouldn't you be talking to me about my future?

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:04.320
Really?

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:06.200
So what are you gonna do after high school?

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.650
Show some interest!

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:10.700
I thought I told you, you can be whatever you want
as long as it's not a NEET.

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:14.070
I'm not gonna be a NEET.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.860
What's this, Hikari? You can't choose a career path?

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.610
Do you wanna study adhesives?

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:19.990
No...!

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:22.070
Anything is fine.

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:24.900
I trust the boy you've become recently.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:27.360
Make sure you have no regrets.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:33.990
Until just a little while ago, you were moody,
always in your room playing video games,

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:35.780
lying around reading manga...

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:39.360
I worried about you...
I was sure you would end up as a NEET.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:41.950
Okay, that's enough badmouthing me.

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:46.700
Well, anyway, as long as Iroha
is willing to marry you, I have no complaints.

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:49.240
I think you're getting a little ahead of yourself.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:52.240
Oh, I am not, either.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.990
I'll knit something for you, too, dear. And Kaoru.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.700
Winter will be over before we know it.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:03.150
Uh, anyway, I am planning to go to college.

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:05.860
Whatever you want to do, do your best.

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:08.030
Yeah, do your best.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:11.990
What about us?

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:18.740
Iroha.

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:20.360
Are you ready yet?

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.610
I know the doctor talked to you.

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.110
You have to stop-

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:27.110
I know.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.570
I know.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:36.150
Ugh...

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:40.450
All you guys ever do is study. It's so boring...!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:44.150
I'm only here because Takanashi is making me help him.

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:46.820
And shouldn't you be doing
a little studying yourself, Ishino?

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:50.570
I'm just gonna go to whatever school
will take me, so I'm fine.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:55.030
But I guess even you start to panic when entrance
exams are on the line, huh, Takanashi?

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.700
Damn right I do.

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:58.530
I'm running out of time.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:03.280
I'm going to use every minute
I have left to do everything I can.

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:05.360
I don't want any regrets.

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:11.780
And by the way, I made a list of all
the things you're going to teach me. Take a look.

00:11:11.780 --> 00:11:14.990
You need THIS much help? What a pain in the...

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.860
I'm going to use every minute
I have left to do everything I can.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:26.780
I don't want any regrets.

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:31.490
But if Ayado and I keep going,
building our experiences one step at a time,

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:34.900
I think our world will change even more.

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:42.570
I want
us to be...
together forever, too...

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:41.490
I want us to be together forever, too.

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:46.820
Hikari?

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:49.740
It's trash day tomorrow,
so if you have anything, I'll take it out for you.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:50.900
Thanks.

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:56.030
You've been at your desk ever since you got home.
I'm impressed. Would you like a snack?

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:56.950
No.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:11:59.820
But I do want a favor.

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:05.950
Mom.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.490
What? Why so formal?

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:10.200
You're scaring me.

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:12.530
Lend me some money...

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:14.280
please.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.070
You gonna buy a textbook? How much?

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:20.400
No. I need it in five digits. As much as I can get.

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:24.360
You could say it's to make sure
I have no regrets from high school.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.990
Anyway, I just need it.

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:27.700
But that's no reason to-

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:28.450
Please!

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:32.450
I've been studying regularly up until now.
I can get into college.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:34.740
And I'll get a job and pay back all the money.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.700
I can put it on your tab.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:43.490
Just make sure you don't lose sight
of what's important now.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:50.280
Tsutsui.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:54.150
You're going to that special lecture
on entrance exam strategies this week, right?

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:58.530
I'm going to trade school,
but I thought I'd check it out, just in case.

00:12:58.530 --> 00:12:59.650
Let's go together.

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:02.110
Sorry. I'm not going.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:06.490
Um, okay. Well, next time, then.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:08.360
Yeah. I'm sorry.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.530
What? The arcade?

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:18.740
Why now?

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:20.860
It's been a while. I want to go.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.990
Is that a good idea?

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:26.280
After all your insisting that
I shouldn't slack off on my studies.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:30.780
Before I started dating you, all I did was study.
I was a study fiend.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:31.950
It'll be fine.

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:33.740
Besides, you said it yourself...

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:38.650
"There are a lot of things in life
that are more important than credits."

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:44.030
I want a change of pace. Come with me.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:45.780
If you insist.

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.070
Here!

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:53.900
Wow, Tsutsun! That's the seventh one!

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:56.200
Is there anything else here you want?

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:58.240
This is plenty.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.900
I want to try playing that!

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:01.990
The taiko drum game!

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.950
Wow, that's unexpected.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.400
The loser has to make a funny face in a photo sticker.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:09.070
I'm not gonna hold back.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:10.700
Game over!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.450
Play again sometime!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.110
You have no rhythm, Tsutsun.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:18.360
What?! This is my very first photo sticker,
and I have to make a funny face? Seriously?!

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:19.650
You promised.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:21.400
Yeah... but...

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.650
You don't have to laugh that much!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.570
B-but...

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:33.320
It only looks like that because
you had to jab me in the ribs!

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:36.950
It's too much!

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:38.860
Damn it all...

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:42.320
But here, look at this one. It turned out really well.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:43.700
Yeah.

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.820
Did you... have fun today?

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:48.860
Yeah.

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:51.070
I had a blast.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.780
Well, good.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:56.200
You know where we should go tomorrow?
That new donut place.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:01.900
Are you sure we should goof off that much?
Though I would like to go.

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:02.950
Right?

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:07.450
And you said you wanted to try
that shaved ice place that always has the long lines.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:08.700
Yeah!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:11.610
Oh, but it's too cold for that, Tsutsun.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:16.150
That's actually a good thing.
It means the line might not be as long.

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:17.240
Good point!

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:22.610
Well, that's all for today.

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:24.900
Oh, wait, Ito.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.610
Uh, sir?

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.320
You're friends with Tsutsui, right?

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.150
Why isn't he coming to the special lectures?

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:33.530
Uh... I dunno.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:38.240
But Tsutsui is smart. Maybe the studying
he does at home will be enough?

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:41.950
No, his test scores have actually been going down.

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:43.150
What?

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:45.490
Maybe he's just going through a slump.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.490
Well, never mind. Sorry for holding you up.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.200
I'll never make fun of an anime movie again.

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.360
Right?

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.740
You wanna stop by somewhere else? Are you hungry?

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:15.110
Yeah.

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:17.610
And do you want to go to the beach sometime?

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:19.780
The beach? At this time of year?

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:21.990
You could catch a cold, Tsutsun.

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:24.740
Yeah, but I don't care.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:26.450
I want to go.

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.820
What is going on, Tsutsui?

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:36.950
I waited to see if you could pull out of this,
but your grades are just getting worse.

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.320
You're planning to go to college, aren't you?

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:41.820
Sometimes you're not even showing up in class.

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:44.820
So what? You're one of those
late-blooming "cool kids"?

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:49.570
You don't have much left of high school,
and I get that you want to have fun, but...

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:50.820
Sir.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:55.150
Between studying, or doing what I can
to make sure I don't have any regrets...

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.530
Which is more important?

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:58.240
Right now, studying is!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.950
Not getting into college would be a big regret.

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:01.740
But...

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.400
You need to cool your head.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.650
Your whole life depends on this.

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:14.280
Tsutsui?

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.490
One more month...

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:19.450
Just...

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:22.530
Tsutsui! What's wrong?!

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:25.360
He was talking to you about your grades, wasn't he?

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:27.820
Seriously, what's gotten into you?

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:30.450
Don't think you can get into college with that attitude.

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:33.650
You don't have to have all your fun now.
You can wait until after you get into-

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:38.070
I'm sorry.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.070
Stay out of it.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:41.530
I can't stay out of it! I'm-

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:43.150
You wouldn't understand!

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.150
Sorry.

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:49.950
I'm going home.

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:53.780
Tsutsui...

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:04.360
That's cold!

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:06.150
That'll happen in October.

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:11.650
Cold! Now you've done it!

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.280
It sure is cold...

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:25.490
We had too much fun.

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:28.450
And you know... you didn't have to throw seaweed.

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:29.950
It's a good look for you.

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:31.320
But I'm cold.

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:34.200
I'll go buy us some warm drinks.

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.200
Thanks.

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:45.990
Igarashi, the thing is...

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:49.200
Tsutsui's been acting weird lately.

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:50.570
I don't know what's wrong.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.900
Have you noticed anything, Igarashi?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:57.950
I heard...

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.900
that his grades have been getting really bad lately, too.

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:06.320
What? He told me he studies every day.
He said everything was fine.

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:07.860
It's not.

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:10.900
He got called into the faculty room the other day.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:13.150
He might be in real trouble.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:21.070
Wow. He brought writing paper all the way out here?

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.700
See? I knew he was studying.

