00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:03.950
Yeah.

00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:07.030
But I might be even warmer if I do this.

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:14.860
Someone's coming.

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:16.990
Who cares?

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:22.530
I just don't really feel like going home anymore.

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:32.950
Let's go home.

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:34.360
You'll catch a cold.

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.200
Tsutsun...

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:39.820
I lied.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:46.990
I'm not transferring schools. That was a lie.

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:52.450
Really?

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:53.990
Good.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:05.570
You know. It really is cold.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:08.650
Let's...

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:11.570
forget about going home today.

